OL,3,GNEWSAPolice drones play 'key role'
OL,4,Apreventing football disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice drones are playing a "key role"
OL,7,Fin preventing disorder at Premier
OL,8,FLeague football fixtures in the West
OL,9,FMidlands, thanks to a #2m pilot.
OL,11,FThe project, partnered with West
OL,12,FMidlands Police (WMP), started at the
OL,13,Fend of last season and uses eye in the
OL,14,Fsky policing to give officers a greater
OL,15,Fview of what is happening outside
OL,16,Fstadiums to ensure crowd safety.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
